## 定义 1：半整数区间上的有限读出

对 \(k=X,\ldots,2X-1\)，定义

$$
y_{2(k-X)}(v)
=
\sum_{k<n\le2k}v_n,
$$

$$
y_{2(k-X)+1}(v)
=
\sum_{k<n\le2k+1}v_n.
$$

记

$$
R_Xv
=
\bigl(y_0(v),\ldots,y_{2X-1}(v)\bigr)^{\mathsf T}.
$$

再定义正权重

$$
\boxed{
d_j
=
\frac1{X+j/2}
-
\frac1{X+(j+1)/2},
\qquad 0\le j<2X.
}
\tag{2}
$$

令 \(D_X=\operatorname{diag}(d_0,\ldots,d_{2X-1})\)。

